  storyText: "Negotiation\n\n\"100,000,\" you say. Ishida smiles thinly. \"You are on Arasaka property. Here, you negotiate with your life.\" Then: \"60,000. And a corporate ID.\"\n\n1. \"Deal.\"\n2. Keep pushing."
